ANACREON 10
Trinity
0 ; random scenario
2 3 30 105 1 50 0 4021
BEGINTEXT


        "...and so the Emperor Gal'Naith fell from power after his 1200-
   year reign.  The Homethought coalition which forced him from the throne 
   soon found itself overwhelmed by the chores of empire, and splintered 
   into rival factions.  The forces of the rival factions tore the galaxy 
   asunder in their quest for power, leaving the very seat of power 
   unprotected.  After the Invasion of 2874, all of the outer provinces 
   lost contact with what was left of central government... 
        "...The home planets of the Trinity Alliance were the first to 
   regain control of their destiny.  Each was headed by a strong Emperor, 
   and distinguished by its own unique characteristics.  The three rulers 
   had one common goal: to re-unite the galaxy under their flag... 
        "...Another driving force behind galactic exploration was the 
   rumored existence of the last base of Lord Hal'tre, which, according to 
   legend, held the last great starship fleet..."

                               From: The Roots of Trinity
                                     by Lord Farley of Dathius
NEWPAGE
ENDTEXT
;
; Define zones for empires -----------------------------------------------------
; Zone 2: Center of the Galaxy, contains the Starship and the Ambrosia worlds.
; Zone 3: Home of empire 1, in upper left corner
; Zone 4: Surroundings of empire 1, rich in metals, poor for food
; Zone 5: Home of empire 2, at middle right
; Zone 6: Surroundings of empire 2, high technology, few planets
; Zone 7: Home of empire 3, at bottom middle
; Zone 8: Surroundings of empire 3, low technology, many planets
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;
DefineZone 2 10,10 17,17
DefineZone 3   4,3   8,7
DefineZone 4   1,1 11,11
DefineZone 5 24,12 28,16
DefineZone 6  20,8 30,18
DefineZone 7 10,21 14,25
DefineZone 8  7,20 17,30
;
; Create 3 player empires ------------------------------------------------------
; Each of the three empires has one of the previously created capitals.
; NOTE: If there are less than three players, then not all three empires will
; be created.  The capitals will remain as independent worlds, however.
;
CreatePlayerEmpire 0 1 7 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 1 2 7 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 2 3 7 0
;
; Create player capitals -------------------------------------------------------
;
; Capital for empire one, this is a forest planet with a large number of 
; transports.  Food is vital in this part of the galaxy, due to a large
; concentartion of volcanic/underground/barren worlds.
CreateWorld 1 Z:3
10 7 4 0 2200 85
0 0 400 50
600 100 200 350 20 10 250
2000 0 0 1500 1500 4000 500
;
; Capital for empire two, 
CreateWorld 2 Z:5
9 7 4 1 2200 85
0 0 400 100
500 50 350 350 20 0 250
2000 0 0 1000 1500 2000 500
;
; Capital for empire three, this is a jungle world
CreateWorld 3 Z:7
14 7 4 2 2200 85
0 0 400 100
400 250 300 350 20 10 300
2000 0 0 1000 1500 4000 500
;
; Ambrosia world in the center of the galaxy.
CreateWorld 4 Z:2
0 5 6 8 500 70
0 0 1400 300
3000 60 130 0 40 0 100
1000 0 0 1000 1500 2000 500
;
; This world is low tech, but was once an outpost of the empire.  It still
; has a large number of orbiting starship.  They will fight with the world.
; A smart player, however, will conquer the world without destroying the
; starships.
CreateWorld 5 Z:2
6 5 6 8 600 60
0 0 400 50
400 10 50 150 0 750 250
400 0 0 1000 1500 2000 500
;
; Two random High-Tech worlds, this adds some competition.
; Also allows a place to add other players in later.
;
CreateWorld 6 Z:1
9 7 6 8 2200 85
0 0 400 100
500 50 350 350 20 0 250
2000 0 0 1000 1500 2000 500
;
CreateWorld 7 Z:1
9 7 6 8 2200 85
0 0 400 100
500 50 350 350 20 0 250
2000 0 0 1000 1500 2000 500
